{"_id":"68a736178ec3d8323af16455","nodeId":"fh5aERX7c-lY9FPsmftoF","roadmapSlug":"docker","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:03.460Z","description":"# DockerHub Alternatives\n\nContainer images can be stored in many different registries, not just Dockerhub. Most major cloud platforms now provide container registries such as \"Artifact Registry\" on Google Cloud Platform, Elastic Container Registry on AWS and Azure Container Registry on Microsoft Azure. GitHub also provides it's own registry which is useful when container builds are included in your GitHub Actions workflow.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"DockerHub","url":"https://hub.docker.com/","_id":"69ca2cc033a0ad7a578dba8a"},{"type":"official","title":"Artifact Registry","url":"https://cloud.google.com/artifact-registry","_id":"69ca2cc033a0ad7a578dba8b"},{"type":"official","title":"Amazon ECR","url":"https://aws.amazon.com/ecr/","_id":"69ca2cc033a0ad7a578dba8c"},{"type":"official","title":"Azure Container Registry","url":"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/products/container-registry","_id":"69ca2cc033a0ad7a578dba8d"},{"type":"official","title":"GitHub Container Registry","url":"https://docs.github.com/en/packages/guides/about-github-container-registry","_id":"69ca2cc033a0ad7a578dba8e"}],"updatedAt":"2026-03-30T07:56:48.897Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e0fb5fcb94d0416d80","title":"DataCamp - Introduction to Docker","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/zzDy1W"},{"_id":"6a5e04e0fb5fcb94d0416df4","title":"DataCamp - Containerization and Virtualization","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/GbEdZ2"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/docker/content/fh5aERX7c-lY9FPsmftoF.md"}